# Quick Start: Build Your First Presentable Demo

## Goal
Create a working web demo in **1 week** that you can share with anyone to test your AdaptiveSLM project.

---

## What You'll Build

**Interactive Web Application** that demonstrates:
1. ✅ Your model running in the browser
2. ✅ Profile selection (Beginner/Intermediate/Expert)
3. ✅ Side-by-side comparison with baseline
4. ✅ Real-time performance metrics
5. ✅ Shareable via simple URL

**Demo URL will be:** `https://your-username.github.io/adaptive-slm-demo`

---

## Prerequisites Check

Run these commands to verify you have what you need:

```bash
# Check if C++ core is built
ls /home/anubhav-hooda/Anubhav/SLM/adaptive-slm/core/build/

# Check if model exists
ls -lh /home/anubhav-hooda/Anubhav/SLM/adaptive-slm/models/*.gguf

# Check if Rust wrapper is ready
ls /home/anubhav-hooda/Anubhav/SLM/adaptive-slm/rust-wrapper/
```

